#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "Modular Table Blocks"
msgstr "Modular Table Blocks"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "Independently editable table, row and cell blocks."
msgstr "テーブル・行・セルを独立して編集できるブロックです。"

#: includes/render-table.php:94
msgid "Scrollable table"
msgstr "横スクロール可能なテーブル"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Text color"
msgstr "文字色"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Table background"
msgstr "テーブルの背景色"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Cell background"
msgstr "セルの背景色"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Border color"
msgstr "罫線の色"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Border width"
msgstr "罫線の太さ"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Border style"
msgstr "罫線の種類"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Cell vertical padding"
msgstr "セルの上下余白"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Cell horizontal padding"
msgstr "セルの左右余白"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Font size"
msgstr "文字サイズ"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Line height"
msgstr "行間"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Table width"
msgstr "テーブルの幅"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Leave empty to inherit. See README for accepted values."
msgstr ""
"空欄にすると上位の設定を継承します。入力できる値はREADMEをご覧ください。"

#: build/index.js:1 build/index.js:2
msgid "Invalid value. This change has not been saved."
msgstr "入力値が正しくありません。この変更は保存されていません。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Table styles"
msgstr "テーブルのスタイル"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "The table grid is inconsistent. Structure changes are disabled."
msgstr "テーブルの行と列の構成に不整合があるため、構造を変更できません。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Split cells spanning these rows before moving or duplicating a row."
msgstr "行を移動・複製する前に、対象の行にまたがる結合セルを分割してください。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Choose a rectangular range inside the table."
msgstr "テーブル内の長方形の範囲を選択してください。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid ""
"The range must contain at least two complete cells. Include every part of "
"existing merged cells."
msgstr "範囲には2つ以上のセル全体を含めてください。既存の結合セルは全体を範囲に含める必要があります。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "This cell is not merged."
msgstr "このセルは結合されていません。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid ""
"This operation would cross a header or section boundary. Split the affected "
"cells first."
msgstr "見出しまたはセクションの境界をまたぐ操作です。先に対象のセルを分割してください。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "The selection changed. Select the row or cell again."
msgstr "選択状態が変わりました。行またはセルを選択し直してください。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "The last row cannot be deleted."
msgstr "最後の行は削除できません。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "The last column cannot be deleted."
msgstr "最後の列は削除できません。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Tables support up to 100 rows and 50 columns."
msgstr "テーブルは最大100行・50列まで対応しています。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid ""
"The table changed while confirmation was open. Review the operation again."
msgstr "確認中にテーブルが変更されました。操作内容を確認し直してください。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "The operation could not be applied."
msgstr "操作を適用できませんでした。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Add row at end"
msgstr "末尾に行を追加"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Add column at end"
msgstr "末尾に列を追加"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Insert row above"
msgstr "上に行を挿入"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Insert row below"
msgstr "下に行を挿入"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Duplicate row"
msgstr "行を複製"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Move row up"
msgstr "行を上へ移動"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Move row down"
msgstr "行を下へ移動"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Delete row"
msgstr "行を削除"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Insert column before"
msgstr "前に列を挿入"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Insert column after"
msgstr "後ろに列を挿入"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Delete column"
msgstr "列を削除"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Merge cells"
msgstr "セルを結合"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Split cell"
msgstr "セルを分割"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Table structure"
msgstr "テーブルの構造"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid ""
"All content will be kept in the top-left cell in reading order. The top-left "
"cell settings will be used. Splitting later keeps the content there and "
"creates empty cells."
msgstr "すべての内容を読み順に左上セルへまとめ、左上セルの設定を使用します。後で分割すると、内容は左上セルに残り、他のセルは空になります。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Rows to merge"
msgstr "結合する行数"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Columns to merge"
msgstr "結合する列数"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "キャンセル"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Delete content?"
msgstr "内容を削除しますか？"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid ""
"This row or column contains content. Deleting it will remove that content. "
"You can undo this change."
msgstr ""
"この行または列には内容が含まれています。削除すると内容も削除されます。この操"
"作は元に戻せます。"

#: build/index.js:1
msgid "Delete content"
msgstr "内容を削除"

#. translators: %d: one-based column number.
#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Column %d width"
msgstr "%d列目の幅"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Leave empty for automatic width. Use %, px, rem or em."
msgstr "空欄にすると幅を自動調整します。%、px、rem、emを使用できます。"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Table settings"
msgstr "テーブル設定"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Caption"
msgstr "キャプション"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Header row"
msgstr "見出し行"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid ""
"The first row is displayed as column headers. Individual cell settings are "
"preserved."
msgstr "先頭行を列の見出しとして表示します。各セルの設定は保持されます。"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Split cells crossing the first row before enabling the header row."
msgstr "見出し行を有効にする前に、先頭行をまたぐ結合セルを分割してください。"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Horizontal scrolling"
msgstr "横スクロール"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Adds a focusable scroll container for wide tables."
msgstr "幅の広いテーブルに、キーボードで操作できるスクロール領域を追加します。"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Column widths"
msgstr "列幅"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Modular Table"
msgstr "モジュラーテーブル"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Choose 1–20 rows and columns."
msgstr "行数と列数を1〜20で指定してください。"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Rows"
msgstr "行数"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Columns"
msgstr "列数"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Create table"
msgstr "テーブルを作成"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid ""
"The table grid is inconsistent. Content is preserved; automatic repair is "
"not available."
msgstr ""
"テーブルの行と列の構成に不整合があります。内容は保持されていますが、自動修復"
"には対応していません。"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Cell settings"
msgstr "セル設定"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Horizontal alignment"
msgstr "水平揃え"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Inherit"
msgstr "継承"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左揃え"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Center"
msgstr "中央揃え"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右揃え"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Vertical alignment"
msgstr "垂直揃え"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Top"
msgstr "上揃え"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Middle"
msgstr "中央揃え"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "下揃え"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Cell type"
msgstr "セルの種類"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Data cell"
msgstr "データセル"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Header cell"
msgstr "見出しセル"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Header association"
msgstr "見出しとの関連付け"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Column"
msgstr "列"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Row"
msgstr "行"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Column group"
msgstr "列グループ"

#: build/index.js:2
msgid "Row group"
msgstr "行グループ"

#: build/blocks/cell/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Table Cell"
msgstr "テーブルセル"

#: build/blocks/row/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Table Row"
msgstr "テーブル行"

#: build/blocks/table/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Modular Table"
msgstr "モジュラーテーブル"

#: build/blocks/table/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "A table with independently editable rows and cells."
msgstr "行とセルをそれぞれ独立して編集できるテーブルです。"

